  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of a city street with a cyclist, in magenta, plum, olive and brown with blue accents on white paper.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on white paper, the same street and cyclist stencil as the other Bike pieces. The cells are sprayed in magenta, plum and dark brown with olive and mustard patches in the buildings and road, and a few sky blue cells in the middle distance. The gradients are speckled and heavier than in the other colourways. The sky is bare paper.",
    "impression": "The autumn colourway: bruised purples and olives that make the street feel like dusk after rain. The speckle in the spray gives it grain, like an old photograph. The most painterly of the five.",
